	annote = {The following values have no corresponding Zotero field:auth-address: Department of Internal Medicine, Loyola University Medical Center, Maywood, United States. Department of Pharmacy, Hines Veterans Affairs Hospital, Hines, United States. Section of Hematology and Oncology, The University of Chicago, Chicago, United States. Division of Pulmonary and Critical Care Medicine, Loyola University Medical Center, Maywood, United States. Division of Hepatology, Loyola University Medical Center, Maywood, United States. Division of Hematology and Oncology, Loyola University Medical Center, Maywood, United States. Department of Medical Oncology, Lank Center for Genitourinary (GU) Dana-Farber Cancer Institute (DFCI), Harvard Medical School, Boston, MA, United States.edition: 20230616accession-num: 37397376custom1: The authors declare that the research was conducted in the absence of any commercial or financial relationships that could be construed as a potential conflict of interest.remote-database-provider: NLM},
	file = {45_Shaw et al. - 2023 - Multicenter analysis of immunosuppressive medications on the risk of malignancy following adult soli.pdf}
